<title>PHILIPPINES: NatSteel unit to study Manila park venture.</title>
<headline>NatSteel unit to study Manila park venture.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>A unit of NatSteel Ltd of Singapore and Crown Equities Inc will study the feasibility of setting up a business park in Manila, Crown said on Monday.</p>
<p>In an advisory, Crown Equities said it and NatSteel Properties Pte Ltd have signed a memorandum of agreement with the City government of Manila to provide funds which will be required for technical and other studies.</p>
<p>The studies will be undertaken without cost to the city government, Crown Equities said.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, CEI and NatSteel will be given the right to undertake the construction of a business park if found viable. The project will be covered by a separate contract.</p>
<p>Crown is a unit of the Tong Yang group of Korea.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (63 2) 8418939 Fax 8176267</p>
